ey":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T07:50:10-07:00","id":857695,"title":"","content":"yes but the kind of repercussions I was wanting to discuss, is possibletys for being betrayed by a duplicitous fence.<br /> <br /> thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T11:35:25-07:00","id":857826,"title":"","content":"A fence who's known to sell out his clients doesn't stay a fence or alive that long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T10:20:03-07:00","id":921545,"title":"","content":"oh one other thing, <br /> <br /> is it safe to say knowing a reasonably Trustworthy Fence is a good Contact.<br /> <br /> any Front Jobs a Fence Can have other then Pawn Shop.<br /> <br /> In all seriousness, likely to come up soon.<br /> <br /> what kind of arrangement would supernaturals fences probaly have<br /> <br /> Not sure how much generousity a Kinfolk Fence should be showing to a pack, on one hand he wants to help them and the tribe, on the other he needs to make a living too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T12:40:33-07:00","id":921629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/853193-looting-and-fencing#post853193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How difficult should fencing be?<br /> <br /> some jewelry any pawn shop should do<br /> <br /> specialized computers, scanners, like pentex DNA Stark Psychiatric institute or the technocracy have, are best sold, if at all to hard to find speciality markets,<br /> <br /> well thoughts on the idea?</div> </div> </div> </div>As hard as you need to make it. Sure standard jewelry can be pawned, but cops DO know to check pawn shops in and around the town the crime was done in.. Cause often that is HOW they get a lead on the criminal who stole the stuff.<br /> Knowing fenses and such, should be a part of your contacts and streetwise skill.. <br /> As to whether you can get them to help you, RP That shit out.. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/853193-looting-and-fencing?p=856666#post856666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Curious, on Supernaturals looking to sell stuff they've looted, how serioous would the potential for repercussions be from a camarilla vamp selling stuff to a member of clan Giovonni, or a setite, or less then totally loyal sabbat member.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>A severe smiting at the least.. Especially cause you are associating with the enemy (even if he is not a 100% loyal sabbat, he is still sabbat).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T01:57:38-07:00","id":924355,"title":"","content":"You folks do realize that you can buy autoclaves, PCR machines, DNA synthesizers, etc. direct off of Ebay or LabX, right? Brand to fairly new equipment is a hell of a lot pricier of course (tens to hundreds of thousands of dollars is a typical price range), but good luck getting full price out of someone for stolen, unsupported equipment that you've probably damaged via indelicate handling (not to mention the impracticality attendant in trying to cart off a lot of this sort of stuff).<br /> <br /> The real value of corporate etc. R&amp;D facilities is in information- drug pipelines and candidates, clinical trial data, prototypes, corporate behavior of dubious legality, etc.- the sorts of things that business rivals or those interested in market manipulation (or criminal intermediaries with routes thereto) might pay very well to get their hands on. Academic laboratories will rarely have either equipment or data actually worth stealing as far conventional criminal avarice goes. I guess you could steal some controlled solvents and reagents to peddle to would-be meth dealers if you really wanted to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10809-andkat","user":"Andkat","date":". 07-01-2016, 05:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10809-andkat","name":"Andkat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T13:48:29-07:00","id":924598,"title":"","content":"The cheapest DNA Testing equipment, last I heard cost $100 or so.<br /> <br /> and is used mostly to confirm &quot;Your&quot; childrens paternity.<br /> <br /> probaly has an official disclaimer<br /> <br /> &quot;we take no responsiblety for what you do with this information&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Oh curious, how big a discount should Allied supernatural fences, give clients?<br /> <br /> Especialy Garou kinfolk. Who on one hand cant afford to bankrupt themselves, but know the pack deserve capital for the risk their taking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 07-01-2016, 05:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T14:50:29-07:00","id":924631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/853193-looting-and-fencing?p=924598#post924598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The cheapest DNA Testing equipment, last I heard cost $100 or so.<br /> <br /> and is used mostly to confirm &quot;Your&quot; childrens paternity.<br /> <br /> probaly has an official disclaimer<br /> <br /> &quot;we take no responsiblety for what you do with this information&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Oh curious, how big a discount should Allied supernatural fences, give clients?<br /> <br /> Especialy Garou kinfolk. Who on one hand cant afford to bankrupt themselves, but know the pack deserve capital for the risk their taking.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say they would be more than willing to give 5-10% more than they might some schlep off the street.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T15:07:42-07:00","id":924635,"title":"","content":"Honestly, the fence might charge a supernatural more. Working with folks who can drag the fence into their complex web of conspiracies and monsters is a tall ask.<br /> <br /> That said, I imagine a fence would offer a discount to repeat customers. Both as a means of encouraging them to come back, and simply because the fence can be slightly more sure that the supernatural won't bring heat down on them (or kill them). Supernaturals who have been dealing with the fence for years probably presume to continue that arrangement, which is usually to the fence's benefit.<br /> <hr /><br /> I think there's something else we need to discuss about fencing: Vampires have the option of sitting on loot for years, or even decades, before selling it. In that case, stealing becomes an investment in the future, trading time now for a less hot product later. And Vampires, as we know, are time rich.<br /> <br /> Now I'm imagining a vampire - probably a Malkavian actually - collecting shiny objects like a magpie. Their haven just being filled with swag, neatly catalogued by date stolen (or alternatively thrown on a heap), and digging things out every time they need to make rent. Items might disappear for decades from their owners, until it winds up on the black market years after everyone who cared forgot about it.<br /> <br /> Come to think of it, that could make for a great plot hook. Some Toreador finds out one of the paintings they did while alive comes onto market, after having been stolen decades ago. Now that Toreador wants the coterie to not only ensure the painting is returned (cue heist of a black or regular market auction house), but also to track the chain of purchases back to the original thief.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T15:41:28-07:00","id":924647,"title":"","content":"Fair Points, Some fences may do that<br /> <br /> Others might ONLY offer their services as fences to supernaturals.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Was told by my mom that with electronics, other then media, &quot;Sooner the better&quot; on reselling it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Bought a $100 coffee machine off amazon on sell for $20<br /> <br /> <br /> Resold it a year latter.<br /> <br /> got $15 for it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Any advise on my extra copy of V20 Dark ages?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T19:24:52-07:00","id":924727,"title":"","content":"True, electronics are often out of date within 3-4 years (at the most, more like 1-2 years).. However art, jewelry/gems/gold and such, are more valuable the older they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T21:02:52-07:00","id":924759,"title":"","content":"Take-home DNA testing kits just test your genome for a number of preselected markers (correlated with heritable diseases and other such things). They have little to do with actual genome sequencing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10809-andkat","name":"Andkat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T08:53:08-07:00","id":924896,"title":"","content":"I heard they were to verify paternity?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T09:28:43-07:00","id":924911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/853193-looting-and-fencing?p=924896#post924896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I heard they were to verify paternity?</div> </div> </div> </div>They are those too, but all in home DNA tests are cheek swabs that go off to a lab, there is no in home machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-03T06:57:28-07:00","id":1224346,"title":"","content":"What can a bonegnawer who decided he'll never visit the abyss again anyway, do after looting the gold path of the abyss , he wont need to worry that much about the police thankfully, but the Store may wonder where he found all that treasure?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"